@@
+# JeRyu Forge
+
+JeRyu Forge is the browser product for JeRyu. It serves a Vite/React app, JSON API,
+and WebSocket event stream from the existing Rust control plane.
+
+## Local development
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run web:dev
+cargo run -p jeryu -- web serve --dev-proxy-url http://127.0.0.1:5173
+```
+
+## Production build
+
+```bash
+npm run web:build
+cargo run -p jeryu -- web serve
+```
+
+## Core routes
+
+- `/repos` — all repositories
+- `/:owner/:repo` — repository overview with README rendering
+- `/:owner/:repo/tree/:ref/*path` — code browser
+- `/:owner/:repo/merge-requests/:iid` — Merge Room
+- `/:owner/:repo/settings/*` — settings
+
+## Security rules
+
+- Markdown is sanitized before rendering.
+- Mutations require auth and CSRF.
+- Repository paths must reject traversal.
+- Settings and secrets APIs never return secret values.
+- Approvals and merges must be bound to the exact visible head SHA.
